  "bio": "Name Brand Tattoo, situated in the heartland of Ann Arbor, has been ingraining tradition into skin with its iconic tattoos since 1999. The studio, with experienced artists like Jeff Zuck and Julian Bast at the helm, specializes in classic traditional-style tattoos, making them a renowned hub for the art in the United States.\nPrice: $$\nCurrent location: Ann Arbor, Michigan, United States",
